// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`TR-6.1 en-US 全命令 --help > aggregate English help snapshot 1`] = `
{
  "(root)": "Usage: figma-dev [options] [command]

Figma Dev Tools - Bridge between Figma designs and code

Options:
  -V, --version                           output the version number
  -t, --token <token>                     Figma Access Token
  -o, --output <dir>                      Output directory (default: "./src/styles/figma")
  --no-backup                             Do not create backup files
  -l, --lang <lang>                       Display language (zh-CN/en-US)
  -v, --ver                               Show version number
  --update                                Check and update to the latest version
  -h, --help                              display help for command

Commands:
  lang                                    Switch display language
  validate                                Validate if Figma Access Token is valid
  token                                   Securely manage Figma Access Token
  info <url-or-filekey>                   View Figma file information
  sync [options] <url-or-filekey>         Sync design Tokens to local project
  component [options] <url-or-figma-url>  Generate React component code from Figma node
  screenshot [options] <url-or-filekey>   Get node screenshot
  metadata [options] <url-or-filekey>     Get high-level structural overview of design node (avoids context explosion)
  lint [options] <url-or-filekey>         Check Figma design code restore quality (pre-check before code generation)
  structured [options] <url-or-filekey>   Get framework-agnostic structured design data (for Vue/Svelte/HTML etc.)
  jsx [options] <url-or-filekey>          Generate React/Vue + Tailwind/UnoCSS component code in one click (vX.Y.Z enhanced)
  vue [options] <url-or-filekey>          Generate a Vue 2/3 SFC component (.vue single file, new in vX.Y.Z)
  svelte [options] <url-or-filekey>       Generate a Svelte 4 component (.svelte single file; tailwind/unocss/css-modules only, new in vX.Y.Z)
  batch [options] <url-or-filekey>        Split a page into blocks and batch-generate multiple component files (with index.ts barrel and dependency graph, new in vX.Y.Z)
  weapp [options] <url-or-filekey>        生成微信小程序组件代码（WXML + WXSS + JS + JSON）
  assets [options] <url-or-filekey>       Download design assets into the project asset directory (since vX.Y.Z placed by bundler: public/ or src/assets/)
  tutorial|help [options]                 Open Figma Dev Tools tutorial and documentation
  mcp                                     Start MCP server (stdio mode)
  wizard|init [options]                   Interactive setup wizard (recommended for first-time use)
  gui                                     Launch GUI visual configuration panel
  cache                                   Manage local cache
  privacy                                 Show the privacy pledge
Examples:
  $ figma-dev wizard                        # Interactive first-time setup
  $ figma-dev sync "https://figma.com/design/xxx" -o ./src/styles
  $ figma-dev jsx <design-url> --node 1:2 --style tailwind
  $ figma-dev -l zh-CN --help               # Show help in Chinese for this run

Shell Autocompletion:
  Install completion script (run once):
    figma-dev completion >> ~/.zshrc     # Zsh
    figma-dev completion >> ~/.bashrc    # Bash
    figma-dev completion | Out-String | Invoke-Expression  # PowerShell

  Restart terminal after installation to use Tab autocompletion.

",
  "assets": "Usage: figma-dev assets [options] <url-or-filekey>

Download design assets into the project asset directory (since vX.Y.Z placed
by bundler: public/ or src/assets/)

Options:
  -n, --node <nodeId>    Node ID (can specify multiple, comma-separated)
  --nodes <nodeIds>      Node ID list (comma-separated)
  --scene <scene>        Scene name (e.g. health, edu, ai-innovation-class)
                         (default: "default")
  --project-root <dir>   Project root (auto-detected)
  --scale <scale>        Scale (1-4) (default: "2")
  --svg-format <format>  Vector export format (svg/png) (default: "svg")
  --bundler <bundler>    Target project bundler (vX.Y.Z): auto (default,
                         auto-detect) | vite | webpack | nextjs | remix | none
                         (legacy publicCdnUrl) (default: "auto")
  -h, --help             display help for command
Examples:
  $ figma-dev assets <design-url> -o ./public/assets
  $ figma-dev assets <fileKey> --node 1:2 --format svg --bundler vite
",
  "batch": "Usage: figma-dev batch [options] <url-or-filekey>

Split a page into blocks and batch-generate multiple component files (with
index.ts barrel and dependency graph, new in vX.Y.Z)

Options:
  -n, --node <nodeId>         Specify node ID
  --nodes <ids>               Comma-separated block node ids (omit to
                              auto-split the whole page)
  --out <dir>                 Multi-file output directory (default
                              ./figma-generated) (default: "figma-generated")
  --prefix <prefix>           Prefix applied to every block component name
                              (ASCII, e.g. Landing)
  --depth <depth>             Max node tree depth (default: "15")
  --framework <framework>     Target framework: react (default) | vue (default:
                              "react")
  --style <styleFormat>       Style format (default: tailwind). Available:
                              tailwind (Tailwind CSS), unocss (UnoCSS),
                              css-modules (CSS Modules), styled (Styled
                              Components), emotion (Emotion), less (Less), sass
                              (Sass/SCSS), vanilla-extract (vanilla-extract),
                              panda (Panda CSS), inline-styles (Inline styles);
                              Planned: css-variables (vX.Y.Z) (default:
                              "tailwind")
  --component-library <name>  Component library mapping: auto (detect from
                              package.json/components.json) | none (default,
                              native tags) | shadcn-ui | ant-design (React);
                              element-plus | ant-design-vue (Vue) (default:
                              "none")
  --attributify               UnoCSS attributify mode (vX.Y.Z, use with
                              --style unocss only; emits utilities as element
                              attributes; off by default = wind mode) (default:
                              false)
  --bundler <bundler>         Target project bundler (vX.Y.Z): auto (default,
                              auto-detect) | vite | webpack | nextjs | remix |
                              none (legacy publicCdnUrl) (default: "auto")
  --vue-version <version>     Vue major version: 2 (Options API) | 3 (default,
                              <script setup>) (default: "3")
  --no-smart-grid             关闭 T21 布局推断（Grid/sticky/fixed/absolute，默认开）/
                              Disable grid inference (vX.Y.Z)
  --no-smart-icons            关闭 T21 图标识别建议（默认开）/ Disable icon inference
                              (vX.Y.Z)
  --no-smart-dark             关闭 T21 深色模式策略建议（默认开）/ Disable dark-mode inference
                              (vX.Y.Z)
  --no-smart-motion           关闭 T21 交互动效建议（默认开）/ Disable motion inference
                              (vX.Y.Z)
  -h, --help                  display help for command
Examples:
  $ figma-dev batch <page-url> --out ./src/components/landing  # Auto-split header/hero/... into files
  $ figma-dev batch <url> --nodes 1:10,1:11 --framework vue    # Generate selected blocks only (Vue SFC)
  $ figma-dev batch <url> --prefix Landing --style css-modules
",
  "cache": "Usage: figma-dev cache [options] [command]

