  -h, --help                display help for command
Examples:
  $ figma-dev sync <design-url> -o ./src/styles/figma
  $ figma-dev sync <fileKey> --output-format dtcg
  $ figma-dev sync <fileKey> --format hex --spacing-unit rem --prefix portal
",
  "token": "Usage: figma-dev token [options] [command]

Securely manage Figma Access Token

Options:
  -h, --help                  display help for command

Commands:
  set [options] [name]        Save Token to system keychain/encrypted storage
